10
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Col. Ferguson, played by James Fox.

11
01:25:48,000 --> 01:25:54,000
Farewell to the King is a 1989 American action adventure
drama film written and directed by John Milius.

12
01:33:36,000 --> 01:33:42,000
It stars Nick Nolte, Nigel Havers, Frank McRae, and Gerry Lopez and is loosely
based on the 1969 novel Farewell to the King by Pierre Schoendoerffer.

13
01:41:24,000 --> 01:41:30,000
Longtime Milius collaborator Basil Poledouris composed the musical score.

14
01:49:12,000 --> 01:49:18,000
The film explores themes of guerrilla warfare,
paradise, island, shipwreck, desertion.
